{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a legendary farmer on an island with many mysteries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117210/extras/0ef8e2a64e05befc149ec5e173915a98.avif?t=1772401115\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 Cute characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd4\u00a0Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Changing seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26bd Lots of physics objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9d Random events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take on the role of a farmer! Farm, fish, explore and do quests to progress throughout the game. There are also seasons in the game which will affect which crops you can grow, which fish you can catch and much more! While the story is quite linear, there's multiple ways to achieve objectives and many of them are completely optional. You can customize your farm with upgrades and store items anywhere you want since they're all physics objects. There are random events that happen every couple of days that can have a negative or positive effect on you and your farm. Be sure to protect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117210?t=1772401115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117210?t=1772401115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117210/fcccb53288822c0e7ba1f6d7fcad27f982c480c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772401115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st